---
const columns = [
  {
    title: '板块',
    links: [
      { label: '人物传记', href: '/#people' },
      { label: '公开组织', href: '/#orgs' },
      { label: '官方 wiki', href: '/#wiki' },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: '参与',
    links: [
      { label: '加入服务器', href: '/#join' },
      { label: '服务器地址', href: '/#join' },
      { label: '新手指南', href: '/#wiki' },
    ],
  },
];
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="hw-shell footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <a class="footer-logo" href="/" aria-label="氢风首页">
        <span class="footer-mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <span style="height: 8px; opacity: 0.6;"></span>
          <span style="height: 14px;"></span>
          <span style="height: 11px; opacity: 0.8;"></span>
          <span style="height: 6px; opacity: 0.55;"></span>
        </span>
        <span class="footer-name">
          <strong>氢风</strong>
          <small>HYDWIND</small>
        </span>
      </a>
      <p>一个以城市、建筑和长期生存为核心的 Minecraft Java 服务器。</p>
      <span class="assist-chip">当前为设计原型</span>
    </div>

    <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="页脚导航">
      {
        columns.map((column) => (
          <div>
            <h2 class="hw-label">{column.title}</h2>
            {column.links.map((link) => (
              <a href={link.href}>{link.label}</a>
            ))}
          </div>
        ))
      }
      <div>
        <h2 class="hw-label">项目</h2>
        <a href="https://github.com/NmouZh/hydwind-web" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          GitHub
        </a>
        <span>内容以 Markdown 维护</span>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="hw-shell footer-bottom">
    <span>© 2026 氢风 Hydwind</span>
    <span>人物与组织内容为示例</span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: clamp(64px, 9vw, 112px);
    background: var(--md-sys-color-surface-container-low);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 7vw, 80px);
    padding-top: clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
  }

  .footer-logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 4px;
    margin-left: -4px;
    border-radius: var(--md-sys-shape-corner-medium);
  }

  .footer-mark {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 2px;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    padding-bottom: 7px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--md-sys-color-primary);
  }

  .footer-mark span {
    width: 2px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--md-sys-color-on-primary);
  }

  .footer-name {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .footer-name strong {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .footer-name small {
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-size: 0.46rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface-variant);
  }

  .footer-brand p {
    max-width: 28em;
    margin-top: 16px;
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface-variant);
    font-size: var(--md-sys-typescale-body-medium-size);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .footer-brand .assist-chip {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .footer-nav {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .footer-nav h2 {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-family: var(--md-sys-typescale-font);
    font-size: var(--md-sys-typescale-label-small-size);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .footer-nav a,
  .footer-nav span {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 36px;
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface);
    font-size: var(--md-sys-typescale-body-medium-size);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .footer-nav a {
    width: fit-content;
    transition: color var(--md-sys-motion-duration-short4)
      var(--md-sys-motion-easing-standard);
  }

  .footer-nav span {
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface-variant);
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .footer-nav a:hover {
      color: var(--md-sys-color-primary);
    }
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--md-sys-color-outline-variant);
    color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface-variant);
    font-size: var(--md-sys-typescale-label-small-size);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .footer-inner {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .footer-nav {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      row-gap: 24px;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }
  }
</style>
